-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §1: the preamble and the annexes are an
-- integral part of the agreement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `1 המבוא והנספחים`

@ref akn:art_1
DECLARE `part of the Oz agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the Oz agreement's preamble`
    `the Oz agreement's body`
    `an annex to the Oz agreement`

-- Each part binds as the agreement does: an annex's table is the
-- agreement's word as much as a clause is.
GIVEN p IS A `part of the Oz agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the Oz agreement` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `the Oz agreement's preamble` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the Oz agreement's body` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `an annex to the Oz agreement` THEN TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the Oz agreement` `the Oz agreement's preamble` AND `binds as the Oz agreement` `an annex to the Oz agreement`
